A vibrant Marc Chagall-inspired dreamlike scene celebrating Chinese New Year: floating red paper lanterns and golden mandarin oranges drift through a deep cobalt blue night sky, a majestic crimson dragon with flowing serpentine body spirals upward surrounded by scattered red envelopes and plum blossoms, fireworks burst in swirls of magenta and gold, traditional shophouses with ornate facades tilt at whimsical angles below, a crescent moon glows warmly overhead, the entire composition rendered in rich jewel tones with Chagall's signature floating ethereal quality and folk art sensibility, magical realism with soft edges and romantic luminosity.
